<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="40" width="600" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(0,112,186)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.0" bold="true"><p>03 · 核心模块 / repo</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="56"><content textType="headline" fontSize="24" color="rgb(0,28,84)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>repo 层面向接口编程，内存与 CSV 两种实现可互换</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="128" endX="900" endY="128"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><table topLeftX="60" topLeftY="158" width="840" height="242"><colgroup><col width="190"/><col width="250"/><col width="400"/></colgroup><tr height="34"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(0,48,135)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left"><p>模块</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(0,48,135)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left"><p>角色</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(0,48,135)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="12" bold="true" color="rgba(255,255,255,1)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left"><p>说明</p></content></td></tr><tr height="52"><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" textAlign="left" bold="true"><p>base.py</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" bold="false"><p>仓库抽象接口</p></content></td><td><fill><fillColor color="rgb(255,255,255)"/></fill><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体"