" width="840" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6"><p>依赖方向：adapters 负责把 CSV / JSON 读成内存对象，repo 负责持久化与查询；</p><p>services 不直接接触文件格式，切换数据源时业务代码不变。</p></content></shape><line startX="60" startY="498" endX="900" endY="498"><border color="rgb(203,213,225)" width="1"/></line><shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="506" width="500" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>invana 项目介绍 · 技术评审</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="506" width="100" height="20"><content textType="body" fontSize="9" color="rgb(71,85,105)" fontFamily="思源黑体" textAlign="right" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>06 / 10</p></content></shape></data></slide>